sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant J as Jenkins / rolling-deploy.sh
    participant OLD as Old replicas (v1)
    participant NEW as New replicas (v2)
    participant LB as Gateway & nginx load balancers
    Note over OLD,LB: users are served by v1 throughout
    J->>NEW: docker compose up --scale (start v2 next to v1)
    J->>NEW: check networks (repair if missing)
    loop until healthy (max ~6 min)
        J->>NEW: health status?
    end
    alt a v2 replica never becomes healthy
        J-->>J: abort — v1 keeps serving, nothing lost
    end
    J->>LB: wait 20 s — discovery sees v2
    LB->>NEW: traffic now spread over v1 + v2
    J->>OLD: docker stop -t 30 (graceful: finish in-flight requests)
    LB->>NEW: all traffic on v2
    Note over J,LB: measured: 686 / 686 requests OK during a redeploy
